  "description": "Karahan Tepe is an archaeological site covering some 10 hectares located in Turkey's \u015eanl\u0131urfa Province. More than 250 t-shaped monuments have been discovered at the site which is associated with the so-called Tepeler cultures. Karahan Tepe lies within the environs of G\u00f4bekli Tepe and may pre-date that site.",
